#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:5 460b939f2e4e48ddb60ac8da879ae378
msgid "What You Need to Build a MultiCopter"
msgstr "搭建多旋翼所需的一切"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:7 f5f3536a1eee4d0886c044a1aedccbf0
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the main components you will need when "
"building a Copter-based multicopter."
msgstr "本文概述了搭建基于 Copter 的多旋翼时所需的主要组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:11 7597380684394f81ab62adca5705a151
msgid "Multicopter frame including motors, ESCs and propellers"
msgstr "多旋翼机架，包含电机、ESC 和螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:13 46f547bef7ef4963accf1f3776c37665
msgid ""
"There are numerous frames, ESCs and motors available. Some components you "
"might consider are discussed in :ref:`Choosing a Multicopter Frame "
"<choosing-a-frame>` and the :ref:`Detailed Vehicle Builds <common-common-"
"airframe-builds>`."
msgstr ""
"有大量可选的机架、ESC 和电机。您可参考 :ref:`选择多旋翼机架 <choosing-a-frame>` 和 :ref:`详细整机方案 "
"<common-common-airframe-builds>` 中的一些讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:18 4f9dea8b491642769d15835af7484dd3
msgid ""
"Many other designs and configurations including Traditional Helicopters are "
"also supported."
msgstr "还支持许多其他设计和配置，包括传统直升机。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:22 faf3cdd562c248f08053b111c68ce5f6
msgid "6+ channel RC transmitter and receiver"
msgstr "6 通道以上遥控器和接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:24 9d3f7c0a8bc54478b232229fa29e74db
msgid ""
"You'll need a radio control transmitter to manually control your Copter and "
"to activate its flight modes. You can use any RC transmitter/receiver system"
" with at least six channels. Some of the options are discussed in the topic "
":ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems <common-rc-systems>`."
msgstr ""
"您需要一个遥控器来手动控制 Copter 并激活飞行模式。可使用任何至少六通道的 RC 遥控器/接收机系统。部分可选方案在 :ref:`兼容的 RC "
"遥控器和接收机系统 <common-rc-systems>` 主题中有所讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:33 90098dd6dd574523ae658f701deaa6fb
msgid "Autopilot (Autopilot hardware)"
msgstr "飞控（飞控硬件）"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:35 c34629eb50cd4d1ea6e3b60bcbec4558
msgid ""
"Copter's autopilot board determines its capabilities for autonomous flight. "
"See the :ref:`ArduPilot compatible autopilot page<common-autopilots>` for a "
"list. An autopilot with the following features is recommended:"
msgstr ""
"Copter 的飞控板决定了其自主飞行能力。请参阅 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容飞控页面 <common-autopilots>` "
"获取列表。建议使用具备以下特性的飞控："

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:39 3ab3c811e5044ad093089e6f97d81f8c
msgid "An SD card for logging, terrain data base, scripting (if desired)"
msgstr "用于日志记录、地形数据库、脚本（如需）的 SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:40 8e22fbf724b3427aae15eaab245d394e
msgid "Sufficient outputs for the number of motors and servos to be used"
msgstr "足够的输出接口以供所需电机和舵机使用"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:41 e656623065f042d4b91782608ec87b3e
msgid "Sufficient number of UARTs for GPS, and telemetry radios, if desired"
msgstr "足够数量的 UART 接口，用于 GPS 和传输数传电台（如需）"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:42 64a9c0379f0e4544b61debe628768b21
msgid ""
"Vibration isolated IMU(s) is very desirable simplifying mounting "
"considerations."
msgstr "带隔振安装的 IMU 非常理想，可简化安装要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:43 f749330cfcd24a9da6b5f906b43bcdab
msgid "Be sure the autopilot includes a barometer"
msgstr "请确认飞控内置气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:44 3a138408cbe14161a5190762d60024e8
msgid "I2C for external compass"
msgstr "I2C 接口用于外置罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:46 278e16d0d951426d9924587d8328e304
msgid ""
"many autopilots have an internal compass, but in order to avoid motor "
"interference, an external compass is sometimes desirable."
msgstr "许多飞控内置罗盘，但为避免电机干扰，有时需要使用外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:48 2f48eff349754dc48f72940ef0fded0d
msgid ""
"Developers creating UAV vision applications should consider using a separate"
" Companion Computer, or a Linux based autopilot board."
msgstr "开发 UAV 视觉应用的开发者应考虑使用独立的伴飞计算机，或基于 Linux 的飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:52 90c3dc59fb124abe856821a8b3ef9db0
msgid "GPS module"
msgstr "GPS 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:54 9fd917d9f10f42ef9fc31068607cf6a3
msgid ""
"Your Copter will *require* a GPS module. The recommended module is :ref:`3DR"
" UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-"
"module>` which also includes an a compass. You can check out :ref:`other GPS"
" solutions here <common-positioning-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"您的 Copter *必须* 配备 GPS 模块。推荐的模块是 :ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`，该模块同时内置罗盘。您也可以在 :ref:`这里查看其他 GPS "
"方案 <common-positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:61 bd10af672e4f4776a8187519e9b15a1d
msgid "LiPo batteries and charger"
msgstr "LiPo 电池和充电器"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:66 ec4d300c706f44a6871a16fdcfd892f1
msgid ""
"Copter requires a rechargeable lithium polymer (LiPo) battery. A good rule "
"of thumb is to use 1,000 mAH (milliamp hours) per motor. For a Quad copter, "
"a `4000 mAH LiPo like this one "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-4000mah-3s-20c-lipo-"
"pack.html?___store=en_us>`__ would work well. While your copter can use only"
" one battery at a time, we recommend having at least two batteries in stock;"
" more batteries means more flight time. You'll also need a `charging station"
" for your batteries such as this one "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-2s-3s-balance-charger-"
"direct-110-240v-input.html?___store=en_us>`__."
msgstr ""
"Copter 需要使用可充电锂聚合物（LiPo）电池。一般经验法则是每个电机配备 1000 mAH（毫安时）。对于四轴飞行器，`4000 mAH 的 "
"LiPo 电池 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-4000mah-3s-20c-lipo-"
"pack.html?___store=en_us>`__ "
"是不错的选择。虽然每次只能使用一块电池，但建议至少备有两块；电池越多，飞行时间越长。您还需要一个 `电池充电器 "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-2s-3s-balance-charger-"
"direct-110-240v-input.html?___store=en_us>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:73 554417719aee415ebd5b0a616d6f1198
msgid "Ground Control Station"
msgstr "地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:75 ed3797c541ae4b07a714a547e2c57bfd
msgid ""
"The (free and open source) :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` is required"
" if you're going to be loading new versions of Copter onto the autopilot, "
"and for first-flight tuning and calibration. It runs on a PC and can also be"
" used for planning missions."
msgstr ""
"若需向飞控烧录新版 Copter 固件，以及进行首飞调参和校准，则必须使用（免费且开源的）:ref:`Mission Planner "
"<planner:home>`。它运行在 PC 上，也可用于规划任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:83 ad2b35765620454fa962d231c84e7e88
msgid ""
"Once your Copter is configured, you may find it more convenient to choose a "
"different ground station - running on the tablet, phone or computer of your "
"choice. The main options are discussed in the topic :ref:`Choosing a Ground "
"Station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr ""
"配置好 Copter 后，您可能会更倾向于选择另一种地面站——运行在您选择的平板、手机或电脑上。主要可选方案在 :ref:`选择地面站 <common-"
"choosing-a-ground-station>` 主题中有所讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:89 78c81313476e42cdacae18d98d8ee4ed
msgid "Telemetry Radio"
msgstr "数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:91 6e7a4dfde28f4cf596c2426f5870189b
msgid ""
"A telemetry radio allows your Copter to communicate with your ground station"
" from the air using the MAVLink protocol. This allows you to interact with "
"your missions in real time and receive streaming data from your copter's "
"cameras and other components. This adds considerable convenience to your "
"missions!"
msgstr ""
"数传电台允许您的 Copter 在空中通过 MAVLink 协议与地面站通信。这使您能够实时与任务交互，并接收来自 Copter "
"摄像头和其他组件的数据流。这为您的飞行任务带来了极大的便利！"

#: ../../source/docs/what-you-need.rst:97 17bb27aebfdc4ce6b20f2ed2bd02dc81
msgid ""
"We recommend the telemetry radio solutions linked from the :ref:`Telemetry "
"Landing Page <common-telemetry-landingpage>`. Remember that if using the "
":ref:`SIK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` you will need the version at "
"the permitted frequency for your country - 915 MHz (Americas) and 433 MHz "
"(Europe)."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐 :ref:`数传落地页 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 中链接的数传电台方案。请注意，如果使用 "
":ref:`SIK 电台 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`，需选择适合您所在国家许可频段的版本——915 MHz（美洲）和 "
"433 MHz（欧洲）。"
